    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Derelict building ready for conversion to an individual property located in the heart of Rathmullan, fantastic opportunity in a prime location.\n\nAn increasingly rare opportunity to acquire a derelict cottage in the heart of Market Square, Rathmullan. One of Donegal`s most charming and sought-after coastal villages.\n\nThis property may qualify for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant, offering an excellent opportunity for purchasers to restore and breathe new life into a traditional home while benefiting from substantial Government support.\n\nOccupying a superb central position, this property offers enormous potential for renovation or redevelopment (subject to the necessary planning permissions), providing the perfect blank canvas to create a distinctive home, holiday retreat, or investment property.\n\nEverything Rathmullan has to offer is quite literally on your doorstep, with cafés, restaurants, pubs, shops, the picturesque harbour, and the village`s renowned sandy beach all just a short stroll away.\n\nSurrounded by stunning coastal scenery and steeped in local heritage, this is a location that combines village charm with an exceptional quality of life. \n\nOpportunities to secure a property in such a prime village centre location are few and far between. Whether you`re looking to restore a piece of Rathmullan`s history or create something entirely new, this property offers outstanding potential in an enviable setting.\n\n\nDisclaimer - The above particulars are issued by Glen Estates on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through them. Information contained in the brochure does not form any part of any offer or contract and is provided in good faith, for guidance only. Glen estates have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. Maps and plans are not to scale and measurements are approximate, photographs provided for guidance only. The particulars, descriptions, dimensions, references to condition, permissions or licences for use or occupation, access and any other details, such as prices, rents or any other outgoings are for guidance only and may be subject to change. Intending purchasers / tenants must satisfy themselves as to the accuracy of details provided to them either verbally or as part of this brochure. Neither Glen Estates or any of its employees have any authority to make or give any representation or warranty in respect of this property."
      },
